  "title": "Wagon Wheel Cookies",
  "description": "These crackly chocolate wagon wheel cookies are packed with nuts and rolled in confectioners&#39; sugar for a nostalgic treat. The recipe is irresistible.",
  "authors": [
    "CHRISTINAMARIERICE"
  ],
